# Overrides in tournament games need a named card (docs/flow.md, "Overrides").
# Seating A B C D: A's prey is B; C is neither.
seed 5
tournament
seat A alice
seat B bob
seat C carol
seat D dave
crypt A "Vera Nightfall" *12
library A "Iron Ward" *40
crypt B "Tomas Grey" *12
library B "Quick Feed" *40
crypt C "Ilse Várga" *12
library C "Quick Feed" *40
crypt D "Tomas Grey" *12
library D "Quick Feed" *40
start

A> draw crypt
A> move A:uncontrolled:1 ready
A> draw 7
B> draw crypt
B> move B:uncontrolled:1 ready
C> draw crypt
C> move C:uncontrolled:1 ready
C> draw 7
D> draw crypt
D> move D:uncontrolled:1 ready
A> next
A> next

reject:forbidden A> bleed "Vera Nightfall" C override
# An untagged card is still accepted, flagged as unverified.
A> bleed "Vera Nightfall" C with "Iron Ward" override
log public A: Vera Nightfall bleeds C with Iron Ward, ignoring the prey restriction (Iron Ward, unverified)
C> pass
A> resolve failure
A> unlock "Vera Nightfall"

A> bleed "Vera Nightfall"
C> hold
B> pass
reject:forbidden C> block "Ilse Várga" override
C> block "Ilse Várga" via "Quick Feed"
log public C tries to block with Ilse Várga, ignoring the blocking restrictions (Quick Feed, unverified)
